# Coldline
# File: .gitignore
# Component: Repository hygiene
# Purpose: Exclude local tools, caches, and runtime state from commits.
# Interacts With: Git and local development tools
# Sprint/Task: Sprint 3 — Project 3 / Task 3.8
# Concepts: Clean working tree
# Tools: Git

.env
.mypy_cache/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.tools/
.venv/
**/__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# Optional captures describe this checkpoint; they are not submission artifacts.
.benchmark/

# Generated by the Task 3.8 reconciler on every pass that changes the stack: the Compose
# override carrying the two committed restart policies. Never edit or commit it; the
# committed desired state is the source, and the public boundary check would reject it.
deploy/.reconcile-override.yaml
